abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of EnhTri-PHV, a trimodal human-virus
  protein-protein interaction prediction framework using ProtT5 sequence
  features, AlphaFold structural descriptors, Gene Ontology functional
  semantics, QICF, and LightGBM.
keywords:
  - human-virus protein-protein interaction
  - ProtT5
  - AlphaFold
  - Gene Ontology
  - LightGBM
